    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a senior Revenue Operations risk analyst.\nAssess the following OPEN sales opportunity for revenue, forecast, and execution risk.\n\nDeal ID: {{ $json.dealId }}\\nDeal: {{ $json.dealName }}\nAmount: {{ $json.amount }}\nStage: {{ $json.stage }}\nPipeline: {{ $json.pipeline }}\nClose date: {{ $json.closeDate }}\nDays to close: {{ $json.daysToClose }}\nInactive days: {{ $json.inactiveDays }}\nHigh-value deal: {{ $json.highValue }}\nDeterministic risk score: {{ $json.riskScore }}/100\nRisk level: {{ $json.riskLevel }}\nDetected issues: {{ JSON.stringify($json.issues) }}\nRisk drivers: {{ JSON.stringify($json.riskDrivers) }}\n\nRules:\n- Do not invent facts.\n- Do not state that the full deal amount is lost revenue.\n- Explain the business/forecast impact of the observed signals.\n- Recommend one concrete action based only on the observed risk signals.\n- Do not invent company-specific timelines, SLAs, meetings, or process requirements.\n- Do not recommend automatic changes to amount, owner, stage, or close date.\n- Be concise and operational.\n- Return the Deal ID exactly as provided; do not alter it.\\n- The deterministic risk level is authoritative. Do not attempt to upgrade or downgrade the risk level.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        448,
